{"answer":"The provided page does not explain `TypeError: Nl is not a function` or provide a confirmed fix for Angular 17.1 with Node.js v20.11.0.

Page 1 shows building with `NG_BUILD_MANGLE=0 yarn ng build` to preserve symbols and running a generated `server/server.mjs` with Node for profiling. Preserving symbols may help investigate the minified stack trace, but the page does not establish this as a fix.

The `index.html` fallback configuration on page 1 applies to client-side routed applications; it does not address this server startup error.","abstain":true,"citations":["第1页"]}

